roject Update", Content="Hi Team, The latest report is attached.", AttachmentFileName="status_report.txt")\n\nTo send an email with a text file attachment embedded directly in the call:\n    send_message(To="teammate@example.com", Subject="Project Update", Content="Hi Team, The latest report is attached.", AttachmentContent="This is the content of the status report file.", AttachmentFileName="status_report.txt", AttachmentHasBytes=false)\n\nTo send an email with a PDF attachment embedded directly in the call:\n    send_message(To="stakeholder@example.com", Subject="Final Report", Content="Please see the attached final report.", AttachmentContentBytes="JVBERi0xLjQKJ...", AttachmentFileName="final_report.pdf", AttachmentHasBytes=true).',parameterSchema:{properties:{AttachmentContent:{description:"The string content of a single file to attach. This is used for text-based attachments and requires `AttachmentFileName` to be set and `AttachmentHasBytes` to be `false`. This method supports only one attachment.",
