 tool will automatically base64 encode the string content:\n    send_mail(Attachments="Q3-Report.pdf,SGVsbG8gd29ybGQ=;notes.txt,SGVsbG8gd29ybGQ=", Content="Please review the attached files.", Subject="Q3 Report and Notes", ToRecipients="jane.doe@example.com")\nTo send a new email with an attachment from a string, string content should be base64 encoded. If not, the tool will automatically base64 encode the string content.:\n    send_mail(Content="Please see the attached file.", ContentBytes="SGVsbG8gV29ybGQh.", FileName="attachment.txt", Subject="Text file attachment", ToRecipients="jane.doe@example.com")\n\nDependencies\n------------\nThis tool depends on the following services:\n    Office 365: This tool interacts with the Office 365 platform to send email messages.',
